    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "When a power plant that broke down unexpectedly, it cut off a huge amount of power for the region. This, combined with a wave of breakdowns across many plants this month, left the grid with little room for error as the hot season squeezed everyone's power use higher. In response, authorities took emergency action and issued a serious warning to the area, but the risk of rolling blackouts affecting homes is now a real and shared worry for all of us.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Everyman",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "how-4",
          "result-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The national electricity system manager declared a power emergency after an equipment outage at a key energy source led to a massive shortfall hitting households. This system instability, caused by repeated failures and a demand spike, forced authorities to implement preventative power cuts. Their grid protection measure aims to prevent worse damage, but it means ordinary people in the affected area face the direct burden of keeping the lights on for everyone.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Everyman",
        "fragments": [
